    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/6e8e219b2027d1e8b238c97a14490b20.avif?t=1535150409\" /></div><br><strong>Welcome to Versus World!</strong><br>Shoot, stab, snipe, and 'splode your opponents to victory in this fast-paced multiplayer FPS. Here, the afterlife of a respawning immortal is seasoned by an up-down crouch.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/de42ead43ecf0db3b91751064aef03b7.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> <strong>Spin the reel!</strong><br>Collect item boxes on the map to give you a random power-up or grenade.<br><br><strong>Get Locked In</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play online against others, and/or take on AI bots.<br></li><li>Play classic deathmatch game types, or choose Siege to tug-o-war over capture points.<br></li><li>Heatmatch game type: Get kills, earn medals, and deal damage quickly to increase your heat index.<br></li><li>3 unique maps: <i>Rogi Park</i>, <i>Web Island</i>, and <i>Meta World</i><br></li><li>7 weapon types, 4 grenade types, and 6 power-up types<br></li><li>Thrust movement ability<br></li><li>Basic character customization</li></ul><br><strong>Weapons</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/472bbbd740095e8492dd926032785201.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Assault Rifle (Burst fire)<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/4db640dfabab20ca09fa6e9499c19761.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> SMG<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/5f0105f0393abfd31bcedbb104c3bf11.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Sniper<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/e24592779629f5a6b0ed9532a4387500.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Shotgun<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/12b2202e554c9465b04f7cbc2dd46e09.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Rocket Launcher<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/9fb67d9efc59d81c7bb52a6748de1251.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Assault Rifle (Full auto)<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/64753f777689616dc8021e55318150fe.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Pistol</li></ul><br><strong>Grenades</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/cfd8926f304ebaa4555384ccddac4c10.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Frag Grenade<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/b8512468d3aa79bb43b94d7b592e6174.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Sticky Spike Grenade<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/c0b5166b26902e79cac2bd563c2ccfc2.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Tesla Grenade<br></li><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758560/extras/1129f1518bc780a20d5f3277a1e21a53.webp?t=1535150409\" /></div> Rogi Ball</li></ul><br><strong>Power-Ups</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/